WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.209
The work makes three contributions.

00:00:02.289 --> 00:00:03.648
It builds RNAInterAct,

00:00:03.728 --> 00:00:09.208
an extensive dataset of non-coding RNA-protein
interactions derived from the RNAInter

00:00:09.288 --> 00:00:12.937
database and enriched with carefully generated negatives.

00:00:13.017 --> 00:00:14.638
It introduces RPIembeddor,

00:00:14.718 --> 00:00:20.263
a transformer that classifies interactions from
sequence embeddings and beats existing

00:00:20.343 --> 00:00:22.683
tools while generalizing to new data.

00:00:22.763 --> 00:00:28.374
And through an ablation study it shows that the two
foundation-model embeddings are not

00:00:28.454 --> 00:00:33.280
optional add-ons but the core of the model's
ability to classify correctly.
